# Local byproducts of the development tools (none of these ship with the mod).
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# The smoke client's captured output, written when a run has to be inspected later.
_extclient-last.txt
# Local notes about where to look for answers. Kept out of the repository on purpose:
# they name paths on this machine, and the maintainer's own notes are not the project's.
*.local.md
# One-off investigation output: live DOM excerpts, CDP dumps, throwaway probes. The
# *conclusions* from them go into docs/netease-lyric-source-design.md; the raw dumps are
# machine-specific and stay local (same reasoning as *.local.md above).
.tool/investigations/
# Release packaging output (built locally, uploaded as a release asset).
dist/
# The project's own trash. Deleting a tool is a `git mv` into this folder so its
# history follows, and this rule keeps the folder itself out of the diff.
.Trash/
